OL,3,AYemeni military says it has 'secured'
OL,4,ARed Sea waterway
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut in conflicting reports, unnamed
OL,7,FYemeni government and military sources
OL,8,Ftold news agencies Reuters and AFP that
OL,9,Fthe forces have only reached the city's
OL,10,Foutskirts.
OL,12,FThe Houthis said they had struck
OL,13,FRiyadh's international airport and
OL,14,Fother sites, but did not comment
OL,15,Fregarding Mokha.
